Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["We show that the iterative Faddeev-Jackiw (FJ) reduction for \
singular Lagrangian systems constitutes a geometrically constrained instance \
of the Matrix Bordering Technique (MBT). For a first-order Lagrangian with \
singular pre-symplectic form, each iteration of the Barcelos-Neto-Wotzasek \
algorithm produces an extended symplectic matrix of canonical bordered form,\n\
\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", 
            StyleBox["m", "TI"], ")"}]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              GridBox[{{
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell[
                    BoxData[
                    SuperscriptBox[
                    StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
                    RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]]], "InlineFormula"], " "}]], 
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell[
                    BoxData[
                    StyleBox["B", "TI"]], "InlineFormula"], " "}]]}, {
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell[
                    BoxData[
                    RowBox[{"-", 
                    StyleBox["B", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula"], " "}]], 
                 Cell[
                  TextData[{" ", 
                    Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]]}}], TraditionalForm]]],
            ")"}], ","}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\nf^{(m)} =\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nf^{(0)} & B \\\\\n- B^\\top & 0\n\
\\end{pmatrix},\n$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "06bb1d25-74be-b141-afa4-aa5c78f0bfe7"],
 StyleBox["\n\t\twhere the bordering block $B$ is determined by the gradients \
of the consistency constraints. Because ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$f^{(0)}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d76adbf1-ddb2-b14d-a985-7e54309eaae6"],
 StyleBox[" is singular by hypothesis, the classical Schur determinantal \
identity\[LongDash]which requires an invertible anchor block\[LongDash]cannot \
be invoked. The regularity of ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          StyleBox["m", "TI"], ")"}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$f^{(m)}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d2c610d0-81a2-f34a-adfb-f0125fd452c6"],
 StyleBox[" is instead governed entirely by the interaction of ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["B", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$B$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "bb8a024c-aec1-f644-9ddd-8eb5e8971107"],
 StyleBox[" with ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"ker", "(", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\ker(f^{(0)})$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "22ac96e4-3de5-a543-9c8b-57d051ee4705"],
 StyleBox[". Writing ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["N", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$N$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9e8715fc-4845-0742-b25c-9d3770e22c60"],
 StyleBox[" for an orthonormal basis of ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"ker", "(", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\ker(f^{(0)})$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "0ed95f68-ce26-784f-b54e-1ddd3a9d98b3"],
 StyleBox[", we introduce the ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 StyleBox["reduced constraint matrix",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 StyleBox[" ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", "\[LongEqual]", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["B", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\Gamma = N^{\\top} B$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "055fc143-4231-1843-b81c-f0cc2655fa6e"],
 StyleBox[" and prove the exact factorization ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"det", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              StyleBox["m", "TI"], ")"}]], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             UnderscriptBox[
             "\[Product]", "\[ScriptL]", LimitsPositioning -> True], 
             SubsuperscriptBox["\[Mu]", "\[ScriptL]", "2"]}], ")"}], " ", 
         "det", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", "\[CapitalGamma]", ")"}], "2"]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\det(f^{(m)}) = \\bigl(\\prod_\\ell \
\\mu_\\ell^2\\bigr)\\,\\det(\\Gamma)^2$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "24323903-e087-dd49-b159-ab2ea14f6c5d"],
 StyleBox[", where the ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[Mu]", "\[ScriptL]"], ">", "0"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\mu_\\ell>0$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3f6b741c-09db-7646-a751-5f9e4851ed21"],
 StyleBox[" are the Pfaffian factors of the nonsingular block of ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$f^{(0)}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e93d2a56-7e49-8c46-a47b-aefdfb20aef3"],
 StyleBox[". This yields the sharp nondegeneracy criterion: ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"(", 
          StyleBox["m", "TI"], ")"}]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$f^{(m)}$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b52f189c-5f02-3c40-b006-b0007f044e41"],
 StyleBox[" is regular if and only if the number of generated constraints \
equals ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"dim", "ker", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "$\\dim\\ker(f^{(0)})$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ef1d3555-b81e-904c-a88c-6b8fe76a7915"],
 StyleBox[" and ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|
    "boxes" -> FormBox["\[CapitalGamma]", TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\Gamma$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4b6f5e7d-6856-a342-96ab-478dd478e4a9"],
 StyleBox[" is nonsingular. Our central algebraic result is that this reduced \
matrix coincides\[LongDash]coefficient by coefficient\[LongDash]with the \
Hessian of the symplectic potential restricted to ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"ker", "(", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"(", "0", ")"}]], ")"}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "$\\ker(f^{(0)})$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f99376b1-8fb1-7740-a519-3c0e0dd49b72"],
 StyleBox[",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "\[Alpha]\[Beta]"], " ", 
         "\[LongEqual] ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{" ", 
            StyleBox["i", "TI"]}]], " ", 
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", 
          StyleBox["j", "TI"]], 
         StyleBox["V", "TI"], " ", 
         SubsuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["N", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{" ", 
            StyleBox["j", "TI"]}]], " ", "\[LongEqual] ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
              SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "\[Alpha]"], ",", 
              SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", "\[Beta]"]}], "}"}], 
          StyleBox["FJ", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], ","}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\Gamma_{\\alpha\\beta} \\;=\\; N_a^{\\,i}\\,\\partial_i\\partial_j \
V\\,N_b^{\\,j} \\;=\\; \\{\\Omega_\\alpha, \
\\Omega_\\beta\\}_{\\mathrm{FJ}},$", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2b7142f5-bada-fd4b-aced-9cfb7285f747"],
 StyleBox["\n\t\twhich is precisely the constraint matrix whose nondegeneracy \
characterizes a second-class system in the Dirac--Bergmann sense.\n\t\tAs a \
consequence, we prove the biconditional ",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"det", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["f", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"(", 
              StyleBox["m", "TI"], ")"}]], ")"}], "\[NotEqual]", "0 ", 
         "\[DoubleLongLeftRightArrow] ", "det", 
         RowBox[{"(", "\[CapitalGamma]", ")"}], "\[NotEqual]", "0"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "$\\det(f^{(m)}) \\neq 0 \\iff \\det(\\Gamma) \\neq 0$", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "911cfa5a-31ac-5b41-ab04-e6a1c99201bc"],
 StyleBox[": assuming the generated constraints are independent, the \
Faddeev-Jackiw algorithm terminates in a nondegenerate symplectic form if and \
only if the constraint algebra is nondegenerate, i.e., when the constraints \
form a second-class system.\n\t\t\n\t\tThis algebraic characterization \
provides a rigorous foundation for automating the Faddeev\[Dash]Jackiw \
procedure symbolically. We present a fully symbolic implementation in the \
Wolfram Language, and validate the approach on representative mechanical \
systems with nontrivial constraint structure. The resulting rule-based engine \
preserves parametric dependencies throughout the reduction, enabling reliable \
analysis of degeneracy, structural stability (when no bifurcations occur), \
and possible bifurcation scenarios as critical parameters are varied.",
  FontColor->GrayLevel[0]]
}], "Abstract",
 CellFrame->{{2, 0}, {0, 0}},
 CellFrameMargins->{{10, 10}, {5, 5}},
 CellFrameColor->RGBColor[0, 0, 0.6],
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9841340518574276`*^9, {3.9841357833696632`*^9, 3.9841359337765503`*^9}, {
   3.996098623194044*^9, 3.996098709556986*^9}, {3.9960987402683353`*^9, 
   3.99609880022892*^9}, {3.9960988380656376`*^9, 3.996098877306782*^9}, {
   3.996838819577301*^9, 3.9968388417253494`*^9}, 3.996838916936735*^9, {
   3.996838956866928*^9, 3.996838979056055*^9}, {3.9968398902534046`*^9, 
   3.9968398933807373`*^9}, {3.9968787573812275`*^9, 3.996878803895321*^9}, {
   3.996881257612156*^9, 3.996881261155506*^9}, {3.996881378458622*^9, 
   3.9968813800586815`*^9}, {3.9968816357836933`*^9, 
   3.9968816582370224`*^9}, {3.996881697460308*^9, 3.996881934933466*^9}, {
   3.9968819705770473`*^9, 3.9968820803447933`*^9}, 3.996882113571415*^9},
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.95, 0.95, 0.98],ExpressionUUID->"1a6105ac-b47b-8e42-a8e8-c7ca13e58017"],

