Cell["\<\
The summary box reports the rank of the extended matrix, the verdict, the \
terminal status, and the two counters. Open it to inspect the rest.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"76b87282-5edf-5142-aa25-cf6c0d717693"],

