 CellLabel->"Out[40]=",ExpressionUUID->"386751da-d328-5546-a615-58f61ca284c8"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The halting matrix is stored on every halt, so the candidate directions \
remain recoverable by the user even though the engine reports no generators.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1387eb05-6457-6e47-8c56-f608d9e72808"],

